    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.4
  m_Text: 'A profile picture discrepancy would be when an email has a profile picture
    that would not be appropriate for the sender. An email from a company is probably
    going to use the current logo. For more unofficial emails this check may not
    be as helpful because it is less formal. For this discrepancy it is just important
    that the profile picture is reasonable in context.

'
