  m_Text: 'Asking for sensitive information would be when the email asks you for
    something like personal information, passwords, or for money. When an email asks
    for sensitive information it is most likely a scam. When an email is asking for
    something it is important to think why the sender would need that information
    and if it would make sense for them to ask for it.

'
